{"version":1,"key":"article:66","content":{"id":66,"title":"如何分隔列表项","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在项目开发，一定少不了显示列表，对于列表项我们往往需要一定的间隔分开，下面就要探讨实现这一效果的方式。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"margin"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通常情况下我们只需要给每一个元素设置一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"margin-bottom","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 即可"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":".item {\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}","language":"css","uuid":"7a6ccc7e-d49f-4327-a291-7cee78e5cd42","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是这样会带来最后一个元素也会有 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"margin-bottom","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这是我们不希望的，这个时候需要对最后一个元素进行处理"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":".item {\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.item:last-child {\n  margin-bottom: 0;\n}","language":"css","uuid":"6a9d880f-bc9a-4663-a724-0ac0d6ce9209","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"或者使用“猫头鹰”表达式"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":".item + .item {\n  margin-top: 20px;\n}","language":"css","uuid":"184837e9-6f69-43bf-9874-8f956c4c0f2e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"margin-trim"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CSS 属性 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"margin-trim","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以实现上述效果而不用这么麻烦，它的取值语法如下："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"margin-trim = \n  none                                                |\n  block                                               |\n  inline                                              |\n  [ block-start || inline-start || block-end || inline-end ]","language":"css","uuid":"47accbac-646a-455d-883d-6cb88f9ea611","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"block","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：块级子元素与容器的外边距会被裁剪为 0"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"inline","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：内联子元素与容器的外边距会被裁剪为 0"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"默认值为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"none","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以为了实现效果，可采用如下写法："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":".list {\n  /* 块级子元素与父容器的外边距裁剪为 0 */\n  margin-trim: block;\n}\n\n.item {\n  margin: 12px 0;\n}","language":"css","uuid":"631d01b5-82e5-47a2-ae31-abefb36136ea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"坏消息是只有 Safari 支持"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_45d99fbf-93c2-439b-9421-ae8dd012d0cb.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_45d99fbf-93c2-439b-9421-ae8dd012d0cb.png"},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"flex + gap"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"更加简单的方式是使用 Flex 布局，然后通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"gap","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性指定子项之间的间距"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":".list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}","language":"css","uuid":"5e088e0d-9129-4240-b3e6-7813d22bcbfa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大部分浏览器都支持 Flex 布局的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"gap","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3085e08d-3365-4da8-9f6e-52f411794185.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3085e08d-3365-4da8-9f6e-52f411794185.png"}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/carlos-A0xv0-vSpkc-unsplash_75409643-24e2-436f-94ad-4b13c620de25.jpg","createTime":1733276359550,"updateTime":1776770510968},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1776770510968}}